Portions of the image encoder and supporting operations are adapted from
Apple's CVNets project:

https://github.com/apple/ml-cvnets

Related MobileViT references include:

Sachin Mehta and Mohammad Rastegari. MobileViT: Light-weight,
General-purpose, and Mobile-friendly Vision Transformer. 2021.

Sachin Mehta and Mohammad Rastegari. Separable Self-attention for Mobile
Vision Transformers. 2022.

Shakti N. Wadekar and Abhishek Chaurasia. MobileViTv3: Mobile-friendly Vision
Transformer with Simple and Effective Fusion of Local, Global and Input
Features. 2022.
